    "updated_at": "2022-02-06T17:09:56Z",
    "body": "> The SSE client cannot assume anything, since it cannot detect whether keepalive mechanism is used at all,\r\n\r\nThis is not true. Per the current spec, the keepalive mechanism is being used. All comments are keepalive messages.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
