    "updated_at": "2022-10-26T01:08:42Z",
    "body": "As I stated, any message will keep the connection alive. If you would like to have your server communicate how often the client should send messages, you can do that using the SSE protocol itself. We don't need to add a header and get the browser or specification involved in the process. ",
