    "updated_at": "2022-10-26T19:50:51Z",
    "body": "Isn't the eventsource the one that monitors the connection state and reconnects automatically? So the eventsource instance would need to know this information. Hence the only option is to make this part of the protocol, because the eventsource has no way of interpreting the data send over the event connection.\r\n\r\nThis is mixing two different abstraction levels if this is to be done over the SSE connection itself.",
